#: lib/tymeslot_web/live/dashboard/calendar/bookable_strings.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Guests can book %{meeting_type} in the hatched times. Busy events, buffers and your notice period are already taken out, so this is exactly what your booking page offers."
